  "title": "The Romcom Formula",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "She narrates romance novels for a living… so naturally, she thinks she can control one in real life. In The Romcom Formula , a trope-obsessed narrator meddles in her sister’s love life, determined to spark a perfect neighbors-to-lovers romance with the hot handyman next door. Armed with forced proximity, slow-burn strategy, and wildly misplaced confidence, she sets the story in motion. Unfortunately, real people don’t follow the script. This is a fully scripted romantic comedy audio drama about what happens when romcom logic collides with reality… and refuses to behave. Think Emily Henry meets Fleabag with a Hallmark twist and a narrator who won’t stop interfering. 🎧 Binge all 9 episodes now Format: 9 episodes, 20–30 minutes Style: Full-cast audio drama with narrator-driven commentary Romantic comedy podcast, audio drama, romance tropes, meet cute, forced proximity, slow burn, full-cast audio fiction, fiction podcast",
